1
00:01:46,450 --> 00:01:48,310
You, as you are now,

2
00:01:48,370 --> 00:01:50,673
just keep supporting me.

3
00:01:51,250 --> 00:01:52,520
What the hell, Rin?

4
00:01:52,580 --> 00:01:55,386
After Isagi arrived,
his power has changed.

5
00:01:55,870 --> 00:01:57,161
That shot just now was

6
00:01:57,221 --> 00:01:59,810
a free attack I launched
to surpass Bachira's imagination

7
00:01:59,870 --> 00:02:02,440
and became the key to the goal.

8
00:02:02,500 --> 00:02:04,669
At that moment, I ran to the most extreme position,

9
00:02:04,729 --> 00:02:06,560
and then was devoured by Rin.

10
00:02:06,620 --> 00:02:08,979
Those three are amazing.

11
00:02:09,039 --> 00:02:12,020
Facing world-class players,
they still managed to score immediately.

12
00:02:12,080 --> 00:02:15,060
The collaboration that sparked a chemical reaction
between Isagi and Bachira,

13
00:02:15,120 --> 00:02:17,015
and then Rin devoured both of their reactions.

14
00:02:17,075 --> 00:02:20,850
Because of that match,
the three of them created this attacking formation.

15
00:02:20,910 --> 00:02:23,730
Even against the world's top players,
they could still succeed.

16
00:02:23,790 --> 00:02:26,230
Admirable, truly cool.

17
00:02:26,290 --> 00:02:28,943
Yes. Such a noble triangle relationship.

18
00:02:29,003 --> 00:02:30,980
A perfect style.

19
00:02:31,040 --> 00:02:34,230
Let me join in
and make it a quadrilateral relationship.

20
00:02:34,290 --> 00:02:37,360
No fair, it should be a pentagon relationship.

21
00:02:37,420 --> 00:02:40,014
Join however you like.

22
00:02:40,500 --> 00:02:42,665
Alright. How far can this go?

23
00:02:42,725 --> 00:02:44,936
Until we win the match, of course.

24
00:02:46,910 --> 00:02:50,691
Even though we scored,
it wasn't me who scored the goal.

25
00:02:51,580 --> 00:02:53,945
Next, I will score the goal.

26
00:02:56,980 --> 00:03:00,201
Bring it on, 17-year-old
representative of the France National Team!

27
00:03:01,411 --> 00:03:04,062
Is he looking for a passing lane?

28
00:03:04,122 --> 00:03:06,397
Is that okay?

29
00:03:06,457 --> 00:03:10,026
(Julian Loki, France Representative)
There are clearly many openings around me.

30
00:03:10,086 --> 00:03:11,838
Here it is! First step.

31
00:03:14,924 --> 00:03:16,074
Super fast.

32
00:03:16,134 --> 00:03:18,553
What kind of explosive initial speed is that?

33
00:03:20,830 --> 00:03:21,770
Bachira!

34
00:03:21,830 --> 00:03:22,872
At full throttle from the very start.

35
00:03:22,932 --> 00:03:26,042
Without slowing down at all,
and dribbling with wide strides.

36
00:03:26,102 --> 00:03:29,170
Crap, his strides are way too long!

37
00:03:29,230 --> 00:03:31,422
Too late by the time I realized.

38
00:03:31,482 --> 00:03:33,943
Your passing lanes are easily visible.

39
00:03:34,277 --> 00:03:36,946
You may have figured it out,
but I'm faster.

40
00:03:39,282 --> 00:03:40,431
Wha...

41
00:03:40,491 --> 00:03:42,310
He accelerated again?

42
00:03:42,370 --> 00:03:44,495
Is this the speed of Loki the Prodigy?

43
00:03:49,125 --> 00:03:52,270
This is the level of the world's elite.

44
00:03:52,330 --> 00:03:54,640
Loki, you're just playing alone. So unfair.

45
00:03:54,700 --> 00:03:56,489
At least pass the ball to us.

46
00:03:56,549 --> 00:03:58,860
Okay, but I'm already satisfied playing.

47
00:03:58,920 --> 00:04:01,512
Finish it quickly and go take a shower.

48
00:04:02,080 --> 00:04:03,663
Can we win?

49
00:04:03,723 --> 00:04:05,873
He's just like a sprinter.

50
00:04:05,933 --> 00:04:07,894
His speed is truly terrifying.

51
00:04:08,450 --> 00:04:11,105
Don't talk pessimistically,
just pass the ball to me.

52
00:04:16,870 --> 00:04:18,946
Are you scared of Loki's speed?

53
00:04:19,906 --> 00:04:22,980
Lack of experience can
narrow your perspective.

54
00:04:23,040 --> 00:04:24,600
I'll leave it to you, Brat.

55
00:04:24,660 --> 00:04:25,643
Okay.

56
00:04:25,703 --> 00:04:28,270
Bachira, stop him.
We'll attack together.

57
00:04:28,330 --> 00:04:29,123
Okay.

58
00:04:32,160 --> 00:04:34,921
(Pablo Cavasoz, Argentina Representative)
Flying out.

59
00:04:35,330 --> 00:04:36,730
He's aiming for the gap between us.

60
00:04:36,790 --> 00:04:38,698
A super-fast reverse spinning ball.

61
00:04:38,758 --> 00:04:39,823
Aiming for this spot?

62
00:04:39,883 --> 00:04:42,345
An aerial battle,
let me stop it.

63
00:04:42,870 --> 00:04:45,056
(Dada Silva, Brazil Representative)
I'll crush you!

64
00:04:48,080 --> 00:04:50,603
Even Aryu couldn't jump properly.

65
00:04:51,854 --> 00:04:53,254
Crap, it fell right in front of the goal!

66
00:04:53,314 --> 00:04:56,007
But there's still time. I can come out.

67
00:04:56,067 --> 00:04:57,290
Move.

68
00:04:57,944 --> 00:05:01,095
(Adam Blake, England Representative)
I'm not interested in men's bodies.

69
00:05:01,155 --> 00:05:04,140
Even Tokimitsu lost
the muscle battle.

70
00:05:04,200 --> 00:05:09,497
Crap. Speed, prediction, ball control,
height, even muscle battle...

71
00:05:12,000 --> 00:05:15,653
all our skills were defeated.

72
00:05:16,160 --> 00:05:21,384
Everything we learned at Blue Lock so far,
it's all useless.

73
00:05:22,870 --> 00:05:24,577
At our current level,

74
00:05:24,637 --> 00:05:28,558
it's absolutely impossible to surpass them.

75
00:05:31,000 --> 00:05:35,565
This is the skill gap
between us and the best players in the world.

76
00:05:36,660 --> 00:05:39,277
They are my target.

77
00:05:40,370 --> 00:05:42,488
Football is truly incredible.

78
00:05:44,448 --> 00:05:47,940
I want to go and reach that level.

79
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:49,328
It's not over yet.

80
00:05:49,453 --> 00:05:52,540
Still... not over.

81
00:05:53,541 --> 00:05:54,917
Rin?

82
00:05:55,790 --> 00:05:56,770
(Leonardo Luna, Spain Representative)
I really like you.

83
00:05:56,830 --> 00:05:58,629
You are indeed Sae Itoshi's younger brother.

84
00:06:00,006 --> 00:06:03,940
You're different from the others,
you truly wanted to defeat us.

85
00:06:04,000 --> 00:06:05,511
Then, I will beat you with all my strength.

86
00:06:13,811 --> 00:06:15,230
This shouldn't be.

87
00:06:15,290 --> 00:06:19,870
If you open your legs that easily,
you'll be thought of as careless.

88
00:06:30,080 --> 00:06:33,312
Don't be sad, this match was just
to evaluate your abilities.

89
00:06:33,372 --> 00:06:35,523
Essentially,
you couldn't have won anyway.

90
00:06:35,583 --> 00:06:38,234
Report their abilities to Ego.

91
00:06:38,294 --> 00:06:40,020
See you later,
unpolished talents.

92
00:06:40,080 --> 00:06:42,256
See you on the real field.

93
00:06:47,178 --> 00:06:49,078
(Blue Lock, Third Selection)

94
00:06:49,138 --> 00:06:52,480
(First Round,
Fight Against World-Class Players)

95
00:06:52,906 --> 00:06:54,286
Rin...

96
00:06:56,228 --> 00:06:58,480
Damn it!

97
00:06:58,540 --> 00:07:01,192
(Lost)

98
00:07:02,943 --> 00:07:04,989
(Blue Lock, Special Meeting Room)
Give each of them 100 million

99
00:07:04,990 --> 00:07:06,810
(Blue Lock, Special Meeting Room)
to those world-class players.

100
00:07:06,870 --> 00:07:09,850
Score one point, add one million.

101
00:07:09,910 --> 00:07:13,600
Such a reckless project, how much money
will you spend before you're satisfied?

102
00:07:13,660 --> 00:07:16,770
Right, explain to me
what the goal of doing this is?

103
00:07:16,830 --> 00:07:18,376
Then, sit properly!

104
00:07:18,790 --> 00:07:21,600
If you love a child,
let them see the outside world.

105
00:07:21,660 --> 00:07:25,341
(Blue Lock Project Leader, Jinpachi Ego)
Stimulation should be at this reckless age.

106
00:07:26,080 --> 00:07:31,520
Adults who have long given up,
I don't expect you to have dreams,

107
00:07:31,580 --> 00:07:32,580
so shut up and stay silent.

108
00:07:32,640 --> 00:07:34,390
Rude!

109
00:07:34,450 --> 00:07:37,103
Enough already, Ego.

110
00:07:37,580 --> 00:07:41,580
(Advisor, Hirotoshi Buratsuta)
End the Blue Lock project.

111
00:07:43,025 --> 00:07:45,051
Why so suddenly?

112
00:07:45,111 --> 00:07:50,350
The players' parents keep complaining
because the project hasn't been clearly announced.

113
00:07:50,410 --> 00:07:54,268
Most importantly,
there have been no results at all so far,

114
00:07:54,328 --> 00:07:56,810
it's best to end this joke immediately.

115
00:07:56,870 --> 00:07:59,875
Alright then, I'll show you
the results.

116
00:08:03,040 --> 00:08:05,480
Chairman, this is a big match.

117
00:08:05,540 --> 00:08:08,700
The time for Blue Lock to change Japan has come.

118
00:08:09,969 --> 00:08:13,431
(Third Selection, Five-Person Room)

119
00:08:14,460 --> 00:08:17,333
We have no way to handle the opponents.

120
00:08:17,393 --> 00:08:21,690
Yes, I thought I became stronger
after coming to Blue Lock,

121
00:08:21,750 --> 00:08:24,108
now I finally realized
my own ability.

122
00:08:24,620 --> 00:08:27,020
But, somehow

123
00:08:27,080 --> 00:08:30,890
or because I followed
the matches on TV?

124
00:08:30,950 --> 00:08:34,683
Now I finally truly understand
what number one in the world means.

125
00:08:34,744 --> 00:08:37,390
I understand,

126
00:08:37,450 --> 00:08:42,059
the world's number one striker
is no longer a dream.

127
00:08:42,120 --> 00:08:44,670
Even though it's very far, it's real.

128
00:08:46,040 --> 00:08:49,370
This realization is the meaning
of that match.

129
00:08:50,120 --> 00:08:50,634
But,

130
00:08:51,580 --> 00:08:53,387
that person is different.

131
00:08:53,790 --> 00:08:58,476
Only he fought to defeat the world-class
player until the very end of the competition.

132
00:08:59,370 --> 00:09:01,877
After being shocked
by that incredible power,

133
00:09:01,937 --> 00:09:06,257
my mood changed to wanting to learn
from them during the match,

134
00:09:06,317 --> 00:09:09,310
I should have been happy to be able to play
against the opponents I wanted.

135
00:09:09,370 --> 00:09:13,560
This was the reality that I had worked so hard.

136
00:09:13,620 --> 00:09:14,325
So,

137
00:09:14,750 --> 00:09:18,120
Rin, being able to regret like that
is truly amazing.

138
00:09:18,910 --> 00:09:21,940
For me, the world is still
something I aspire to.

139
00:09:22,000 --> 00:09:25,586
While for you, they are
equal opponents who must be defeated.

140
00:09:26,450 --> 00:09:30,250
I'm sure, only someone like him can
compete to become number one in the world.

141
00:09:31,040 --> 00:09:35,350
Rin, I want to be
in the closest place to you,

142
00:09:35,410 --> 00:09:38,080
to surpass you and become number one in the world.

143
00:09:45,022 --> 00:09:46,100
(Third Selection Second Round Very Important
Language Learning From English)

144
00:09:46,160 --> 00:09:50,100
Sunday, Monday, Tuesday,

145
00:09:50,160 --> 00:09:52,905
Wed...

146
00:09:53,864 --> 00:09:55,600
Wedonesday?

147
00:09:55,660 --> 00:09:57,060
The correct one is Wednesday, Stupid!

148
00:09:57,120 --> 00:09:59,980
Aside from Sunday,
you pronounced all the others wrong.

149
00:10:00,040 --> 00:10:02,020
How did you get into high school?

150
00:10:02,080 --> 00:10:03,440
Rin,

151
00:10:03,500 --> 00:10:04,520
when introducing yourself,

152
00:10:04,580 --> 00:10:07,690
instead of my name is, it's better to use I'm, is that right?

153
00:10:07,750 --> 00:10:09,020
Rin,

154
00:10:09,080 --> 00:10:11,560
I'm gently biting my tongue, th.

155
00:10:11,620 --> 00:10:13,801
Th is pronounced like this, right?

156
00:10:15,261 --> 00:10:16,600
(Yoichi Isagi Decides
To Start Learning By Listening)

157
00:10:16,660 --> 00:10:20,440
Rin, tell me,
you're the only one I can rely on.

158
00:10:20,500 --> 00:10:22,560
Th...

159
00:10:22,620 --> 00:10:24,020
is it right or not?

160
00:10:24,080 --> 00:10:27,755
I'm not your private tutor.

161
00:10:27,815 --> 00:10:30,734
I can Friday.

162
00:10:32,250 --> 00:10:34,310
Who can endure days like these?

163
00:10:34,370 --> 00:10:37,060
Actually, how much longer do we have to
go through days like this?

164
00:10:37,120 --> 00:10:39,850
No, to be able to be active on the world stage,
one day it will definitely be useful!

165
00:10:39,910 --> 00:10:41,040
Damn it!

166
00:10:41,700 --> 00:10:43,940
I am sorry, Mustache Prime Minister.

167
00:10:44,000 --> 00:10:45,731
Shave.

168
00:10:45,791 --> 00:10:48,660
- Th... it hurts, I bit my tongue.
- Start again.

169
00:10:50,950 --> 00:10:54,341
The entire second selection just finished.

170
00:10:54,750 --> 00:10:57,970
All the players who advanced
to the third selection have gathered.

171
00:10:58,450 --> 00:10:59,690
It's over?

172
00:10:59,750 --> 00:11:01,247
Are we finally continuing?

173
00:11:01,307 --> 00:11:03,959
- I happened to be bored studying.
- Please wear your uniforms

174
00:11:04,019 --> 00:11:07,897
and gather in the hall immediately.

175
00:11:08,410 --> 00:11:11,423
Alright, the next stage is about to begin.

176
00:11:11,483 --> 00:11:15,469
There are seven teams that passed the second selection,
the total number of players is 35.

177
00:11:15,529 --> 00:11:18,931
Please enter the hall in order.

178
00:11:18,991 --> 00:11:23,190
There are only seven teams,
too many have been eliminated.

179
00:11:23,250 --> 00:11:24,230
Yes.

180
00:11:24,290 --> 00:11:28,334
Initially there were 300 people,
265 people were eliminated.

181
00:11:29,330 --> 00:11:32,588
Did they manage to pass?

182
00:11:33,080 --> 00:11:36,500
Are you missing Team Z?

183
00:11:37,330 --> 00:11:40,850
No, I was just thinking
if they got stronger?

184
00:11:40,910 --> 00:11:44,141
And, to what stage did they evolve?
Just that.

185
00:11:44,580 --> 00:11:49,688
Not just them,
there are other great people, aren't there?

186
00:11:51,120 --> 00:11:55,467
First, the first team that passed
the selection please enter the hall.

187
00:11:55,527 --> 00:11:58,929
(First Team To Pass The Selection
Rin, Aryu, Tokimitsu, Bachira, Isagi)

188
00:11:58,989 --> 00:12:00,810
(Third Selection, Hall)

189
00:12:00,870 --> 00:12:03,940
I feel a little nervous.

190
00:12:04,000 --> 00:12:06,440
Which players passed?

191
00:12:06,500 --> 00:12:10,167
Anyway, the weak ones definitely couldn't pass.

192
00:12:10,580 --> 00:12:15,020
Yes, only those who passed through matches
could make it here.

193
00:12:15,080 --> 00:12:19,575
Next, the second team that passed
the selection please enter the hall.

194
00:12:19,635 --> 00:12:21,640
No matter what way,

195
00:12:21,700 --> 00:12:25,780
I have to reach this place,
only then can I become number one in the world.

196
00:12:25,840 --> 00:12:28,686
Whatever the result, just accept it.

197
00:12:29,200 --> 00:12:31,290
This place is Blue Lock.

198
00:12:34,608 --> 00:12:38,510
(Second Team To Pass
Nagi, Barou, Chigiri, Tsurugi, Kiyora)

199
00:12:38,570 --> 00:12:40,980
Hey!

200
00:12:41,040 --> 00:12:42,940
Trash, I'm here.

201
00:12:43,000 --> 00:12:44,980
Haven't seen you in a million years.

202
00:12:47,246 --> 00:12:49,390
Hey!

203
00:12:49,450 --> 00:12:50,850
Zantetsu is here too.

204
00:12:50,910 --> 00:12:52,850
You guys came too.

205
00:12:52,910 --> 00:12:54,109
You guys...

206
00:12:54,169 --> 00:12:55,940
I'm the 4th person.

207
00:12:56,000 --> 00:12:57,060
He's the 5th person.

208
00:12:57,120 --> 00:12:57,873
Please guide me.

209
00:12:57,913 --> 00:12:58,626
Huh?

210
00:12:58,666 --> 00:13:01,135
Isagi, what's with that relieved expression?

211
00:13:01,700 --> 00:13:03,850
Don't tell me,
you thought we couldn't pass?

212
00:13:03,910 --> 00:13:05,913
No, I didn't...

213
00:13:05,973 --> 00:13:09,140
Don't look at us
with condescending eyes.

214
00:13:09,200 --> 00:13:10,980
Who do you think you are?

215
00:13:11,040 --> 00:13:13,390
It seems, we've been completely
regarded as supporting characters.

216
00:13:13,450 --> 00:13:14,730
I'm not like that.

217
00:13:14,790 --> 00:13:18,020
I'm just really happy.

218
00:13:18,080 --> 00:13:21,350
To be able to meet you guys again,
I'm sincerely happy.

219
00:13:21,410 --> 00:13:23,389
Of course we'll meet again.

220
00:13:23,449 --> 00:13:27,309
I already lost to you,
how could I give up so easily?

221
00:13:27,369 --> 00:13:31,772
I haven't killed you yet
and I haven't beaten the top three.

222
00:13:31,832 --> 00:13:35,252
Just consider it a bad bond
in our fate.

223
00:13:36,500 --> 00:13:39,350
Yeah, if there's a chance,
let's play against each other again.

224
00:13:39,410 --> 00:13:42,032
They really are amazing!

225
00:13:42,092 --> 00:13:46,180
Next is the subsequent team that passed,
please come in.

226
00:13:52,540 --> 00:13:54,600
All of them are people I don't know.

227
00:13:54,660 --> 00:13:57,940
Anyway,
we weren't the only ones playing matches.

228
00:13:58,000 --> 00:13:58,757
Please guide me.

229
00:13:58,817 --> 00:14:00,600
Hello.

230
00:14:02,112 --> 00:14:03,887
Please guide me.

231
00:14:05,160 --> 00:14:09,184
In this situation, there's no need to greet, right?

232
00:14:09,244 --> 00:14:12,396
Next is the fourth team that passed,
please come in.

233
00:14:24,000 --> 00:14:25,520
Looks really amazing.

234
00:14:25,580 --> 00:14:27,980
In total, seven teams passed.

235
00:14:28,040 --> 00:14:30,100
So, there are three more teams.

236
00:14:30,160 --> 00:14:34,251
Next is the fifth team that passed,
please come in.

237
00:14:37,815 --> 00:14:39,840
Niko.

238
00:14:43,529 --> 00:14:45,640
I knew you would pass.

239
00:14:45,700 --> 00:14:47,931
We can clash on the soccer field again.

240
00:14:47,991 --> 00:14:49,770
I already told you,

241
00:14:49,830 --> 00:14:52,079
the one who will defeat you is me.

242
00:14:52,955 --> 00:14:55,350
Seems like there's one person missing.

243
00:14:55,410 --> 00:14:57,850
Hajime Nishioka from the fifth team that passed

244
00:14:57,910 --> 00:15:01,310
was injured in the third selection when playing
against the world-class players.

245
00:15:01,370 --> 00:15:02,237
Currently receiving treatment.

246
00:15:02,297 --> 00:15:05,020
That's Nishioka from Aomori High School.

247
00:15:05,080 --> 00:15:09,221
Seems like everyone came here after playing
against the world-class players.

248
00:15:09,700 --> 00:15:11,520
There are two more teams.

249
00:15:11,580 --> 00:15:13,690
They will come, won't they?

250
00:15:13,750 --> 00:15:17,350
Next is the sixth team that passed,
please come in.

251
00:15:17,410 --> 00:15:19,100
I said don't push.

252
00:15:19,160 --> 00:15:22,060
I want to look cool
standing in the middle.

253
00:15:22,120 --> 00:15:24,802
I told you, all of you move aside.

254
00:15:24,862 --> 00:15:25,730
You guys, stop it.

255
00:15:25,790 --> 00:15:27,270
It hurts.

256
00:15:28,490 --> 00:15:30,265
Raichi, Gagamaru!

257
00:15:30,325 --> 00:15:33,352
Stupid, I warned you!

258
00:15:33,412 --> 00:15:35,187
What a terrible entrance.

259
00:15:35,247 --> 00:15:36,647
Hmph!

260
00:15:39,450 --> 00:15:41,485
They still haven't changed.

261
00:15:41,545 --> 00:15:45,810
There are many people
I haven't seen for a long time.

262
00:15:45,870 --> 00:15:47,890
Gagamaru, you...

263
00:15:47,950 --> 00:15:50,160
I said, stand up!

264
00:15:50,220 --> 00:15:52,538
Is big brother Wanima talking?

265
00:15:52,598 --> 00:15:56,185
We can clash again.

266
00:15:57,330 --> 00:15:59,790
One more team left.

267
00:16:00,950 --> 00:16:04,174
Reo and Kunigami still haven't come.

268
00:16:04,234 --> 00:16:07,310
No, they will definitely come.

269
00:16:07,370 --> 00:16:09,680
They are not people who
will stop here.

270
00:16:09,740 --> 00:16:14,870
Finally, the seventh team that passed,
please come in.

271
00:16:16,950 --> 00:16:19,940
Namusan.

272
00:16:20,000 --> 00:16:21,390
Chestnut Head!

273
00:16:32,910 --> 00:16:34,200
Reo.

274
00:16:35,224 --> 00:16:36,415
There is one more person.

275
00:16:36,475 --> 00:16:38,477
The last person is...

276
00:16:47,611 --> 00:16:50,100
Everyone has arrived.

277
00:16:54,410 --> 00:16:55,851
Kunigami...

278
00:16:55,911 --> 00:16:58,310
Where is Kunigami?

279
00:16:58,370 --> 00:17:01,750
These are the players who
managed to pass to the third selection.

280
00:17:02,200 --> 00:17:05,842
Reo, why aren't you with Kunigami?

281
00:17:05,903 --> 00:17:07,349
Why?

282
00:17:07,410 --> 00:17:08,940
We lost,

283
00:17:09,000 --> 00:17:10,675
and I was chosen.

284
00:17:12,010 --> 00:17:16,020
He is not someone who can
become the best striker in the world.

285
00:17:16,079 --> 00:17:17,497
That simple.

286
00:17:17,557 --> 00:17:19,310
Liar!

287
00:17:19,369 --> 00:17:23,086
He... Kunigami's soccer journey,
can't end like this!

288
00:17:23,146 --> 00:17:24,849
It's over.

289
00:17:24,910 --> 00:17:28,109
I was the one who stylishly
kicked him into hell.

290
00:17:29,319 --> 00:17:32,480
His physique was indeed not bad.

291
00:17:32,540 --> 00:17:36,480
His nature was honest, kind-hearted, and naive.

292
00:17:36,540 --> 00:17:37,286
It's just...

293
00:17:37,830 --> 00:17:42,480
no matter how good a nature is,
it's useless on this field.

294
00:17:42,540 --> 00:17:46,378
Someone who relies on momentary explosions,
is nothing more than trash.

295
00:17:46,790 --> 00:17:49,690
That innocent and naive hero,

296
00:17:49,750 --> 00:17:54,117
is nothing more than a slime that cannot
develop in my life.

297
00:17:54,177 --> 00:17:57,454
Watch your mouth!
What do you know about Kunigami?

298
00:17:57,514 --> 00:18:00,730
I told you,
that story between you guys...

299
00:18:00,790 --> 00:18:02,728
is completely useless!

300
00:18:04,438 --> 00:18:05,440
Chigiri?

301
00:18:05,500 --> 00:18:07,464
What's with him? So annoying.

302
00:18:07,524 --> 00:18:11,390
Right. If you want to fight, I'll take you on.

303
00:18:11,450 --> 00:18:14,190
To me, you're the slime,

304
00:18:14,250 --> 00:18:15,365
Burnt Cockroach Mustache.

305
00:18:16,000 --> 00:18:19,142
This is not a burnt color,
it's a healthy wheat color.

306
00:18:19,202 --> 00:18:23,146
Enough, don't fight,
unpolished talents.

307
00:18:23,206 --> 00:18:27,359
You have no time to worry
about those who are eliminated.

308
00:18:27,419 --> 00:18:33,690
Your soccer journey
will soon be fated like Blue Lock,

309
00:18:33,750 --> 00:18:36,370
becoming worthless trash
and disappearing without a trace.

310
00:18:37,660 --> 00:18:39,730
Anyway, everyone,

311
00:18:39,790 --> 00:18:44,350
facing the world-class players
made you feel like a failure, right?

312
00:18:44,410 --> 00:18:46,878
I'll tell you the meaning of it another time.

313
00:18:46,938 --> 00:18:50,730
How to say it?
Because of various reasons,

314
00:18:50,790 --> 00:18:52,194
I have to change the plan.

315
00:18:52,950 --> 00:18:59,480
The higher-ups of Japanese football,
seem to want to destroy Blue Lock.

316
00:18:59,540 --> 00:19:03,497
So, I challenged them.

317
00:19:04,160 --> 00:19:07,600
Therefore, the third selection
in the next three weeks

318
00:19:07,660 --> 00:19:10,580
will determine the life and death of Blue Lock.

319
00:19:11,370 --> 00:19:17,177
A special match:
Japan U20 National Team vs. the Blue Lock Eleven.

320
00:19:19,950 --> 00:19:21,600
As long as we win this match,

321
00:19:21,660 --> 00:19:26,626
Blue Lock will be able to seize
the position of the Japan U20 National Team.

322
00:19:26,686 --> 00:19:28,140
Seize?

323
00:19:28,200 --> 00:19:32,215
Does that mean we will become
the Japan National Team?

324
00:19:32,275 --> 00:19:37,770
We are just a bunch of high school kids.
Besides, all of us are strikers.

325
00:19:37,830 --> 00:19:41,308
So, they accepted this challenge
while looking down on us.

326
00:19:41,368 --> 00:19:45,350
Their goal is
to destroy the Blue Lock plan

327
00:19:45,410 --> 00:19:49,440
and reap profits by taking advantage
of this nationally sensational match.

328
00:19:49,500 --> 00:19:52,778
As a result, if we lose,
besides becoming a laughingstock,

329
00:19:52,838 --> 00:19:58,200
we will be recorded in Japanese soccer history
as a tragic example of failed development.

330
00:19:58,260 --> 00:20:01,286
How do you feel
after hearing this?

331
00:20:01,346 --> 00:20:03,288
Are you upset for being underestimated,

332
00:20:03,348 --> 00:20:06,750
or do you want to show your abilities
and make them stunned?

333
00:20:06,810 --> 00:20:10,939
After considering the current situation
and evaluating calmly,

334
00:20:12,649 --> 00:20:14,390
you, as you are now,

335
00:20:14,450 --> 00:20:16,862
can revolutionize Japanese football.

336
00:20:17,946 --> 00:20:19,310
Even so,

337
00:20:19,370 --> 00:20:22,390
to guarantee their victory,
they have already made various preparations.

338
00:20:22,450 --> 00:20:25,600
Besides deploying active players,
they are including one more person.

339
00:20:25,660 --> 00:20:28,188
Sae Itoshi is joining the Japan team for the first time.

340
00:20:37,950 --> 00:20:41,440
Alright, the time to put everything
on the line has come.

341
00:20:41,500 --> 00:20:44,440
You can already be egoists,
also combining ability and harmony.

342
00:20:44,500 --> 00:20:48,440
After facing the world's best players,
for the 35 of you here,

343
00:20:48,500 --> 00:20:53,140
the throne of the Japan U20 National Team
is no longer just a dream,

344
00:20:53,200 --> 00:20:55,830
but a reality you can grasp
just by reaching out your hand.

345
00:20:57,027 --> 00:21:00,140
Go forward, unpolished talents.

346
00:21:00,200 --> 00:21:02,810
The ones who will change the world, are us,

347
00:21:02,870 --> 00:21:04,910
Blue Lock.

348
00:21:07,410 --> 00:21:11,041
(Episode 24: The Time Has Come)

349
00:21:21,540 --> 00:21:23,762
Isagi, no one is guarding me here!

350
00:21:25,300 --> 00:21:28,391
One for all, all for one.

351
00:21:29,040 --> 00:21:33,396
I used to think, soccer is a sport
where 11 people fight together.

352
00:21:34,306 --> 00:21:35,380
But,

353
00:21:35,440 --> 00:21:37,943
I no longer think so now.

354
00:21:40,779 --> 00:21:45,056
In soccer,
the one who scores is the greatest.

355
00:21:45,116 --> 00:21:49,102
Soccer exists for the striker.

356
00:21:49,162 --> 00:21:50,770
And a striker,

357
00:21:50,830 --> 00:21:53,356
feels happy because they score for themselves.

358
00:21:53,416 --> 00:21:56,000
More than that,
they live for this moment.

359
00:21:56,711 --> 00:22:01,072
I will not fight for you.

360
00:22:01,132 --> 00:22:05,230
Moreover, I will not fight to carry anyone's dream!

361
00:22:05,290 --> 00:22:06,930
I am myself!

362
00:22:07,370 --> 00:22:10,290
This is my own dream,

363
00:22:10,350 --> 00:22:12,250
my own fight.

364
00:22:12,310 --> 00:22:14,910
I am very happy to be able to
play against you.

365
00:22:24,290 --> 00:22:28,660
Therefore, I will keep moving forward
by stepping over your corpses.

366
00:22:31,200 --> 00:22:35,750
Until recently, I was a player no one knew.

367
00:22:36,376 --> 00:22:41,320
Now, if I win, I will become a player for the Japan U20 National Team.

368
00:22:41,380 --> 00:22:45,969
In this match, I will change my life by relying on myself.

369
00:22:46,660 --> 00:22:50,789
We gathered here to win.

370
00:22:50,849 --> 00:22:53,450
Blue Lock cannot end like this.

371
00:22:54,700 --> 00:22:59,024
I will use my goals to change this world.

372
00:23:00,750 --> 00:23:03,770
The one who will become the best striker in the world is...

373
00:23:03,830 --> 00:23:05,238
me!